name: Auto Zoom
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/auto-zoom/icon.svg
version: 1.0.1
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Automatically fits the document to your screen whenever its size, shape, or orientation changes, with optional Auto Focus (zooms in to where you're writing) and Auto Cursor Align (keeps your cursor centered on screen as you type).
